{"id": "16-830-2-5", "zh": "mida、meda（二根）用于“理解”与“伤害”二义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-830-6-7", "zh": "midati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-830-8-9", "zh": "medati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-831-2-5", "zh": "nida、neda（二根）用于“轻蔑”与“临近”二义。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-831-6-8", "zh": "kucchā 就是呵责。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-831-9-11", "zh": "sannikarisa 是一种特定的用语。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-831-12-13", "zh": "nidati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-831-14-15", "zh": "nedati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-832-2-4", "zh": "bundi（根）用于“磨利”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-832-5-8", "zh": "nisāna 就是磨砺、锋利。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-832-9-10", "zh": "bundati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-832-11-12", "zh": "bondi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-833-2-7", "zh": "这里的**bondi**是指身体。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-833-8-30", "zh": "因为身体里有锋利的东西——或是离间语、粗恶语等，或是智慧、精进等——所以称为**bondi**；虽然后面接的是复辅音，u 音仍替换为 o 音。这个意思应按恶人与善人两种情形来理解。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-833-31-35", "zh": "而 bondi 一词用来指身体，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-834-2-13", "zh": "“我不会再、绝不会再，也不会一次又一次，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-835-2-10", "zh": "进入大象的身体，因为我实在被恐惧吓坏了”等句中", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-836-2-3", "zh": "可以见到。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-836-4-6", "zh": "身体的名称有以下这些：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-837-2-9", "zh": "kāya、deha 和 sarīra，vapu、bimba 与 viggaha；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-838-2-9", "zh": "bondi、gatta 以及 tanu，还有 attabhāva 和 upadhi；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-839-2-8", "zh": "再加上 samussaya，这些都是身体的名称。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-840-2-5", "zh": "vada（根）用于清晰的言语。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-840-6-9", "zh": "vadati、vajjati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-840-10-17", "zh": "vadeti、ovadati、ovadeti、paṭivadati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-840-18-25", "zh": "abhivadati、anuvadati、upavadati、apavadati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-840-26-27", "zh": "nivadati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-840-28-30", "zh": "其他形式也应照此组合出来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-840-31-45", "zh": "其中，因为圣典里见到“请诸位告诉母亲”（vajjantu bhonto ammaṃ）这句话，所以列出了**vajjati**这个词。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-840-46-68", "zh": "但有些老师主张用 vajjeti 这个形式，应当加以审察，如果合理就采纳。“优婆塞对比丘说话（vadeti）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-840-69-85", "zh": "大牟尼用那种方法教诫（ovadeti）众人。”因为见到这些句子，所以列出了 vadeti 和**ovadeti**。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-840-86-88", "zh": "这些全都是单纯主动形式。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-841-2-10", "zh": "ovādeti、vādayati、vādāpeti、vādāpayati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-841-11-17", "zh": "vajjento、vajjayanto，这些都是使役形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-842-2-10", "zh": "被动语态有：“vadiyati、ovadiyati、vajjiyati。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-842-11-25", "zh": "vadiyamāno、vajjamāno、ovadiyamāno、ovajjamāno na karoti sāsanaṃ（被劝说、被教诫时却不遵行教导）”等形式。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-842-26-56", "zh": "“vāda、ovāda、paṭivāda、pavāda、abhivādana、anuvāda、upavāda、apavāda、vivāda、nivādana、vajja、vadana”等名词形式，也应照此组合出来。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-843-2-16", "zh": "“vadituṃ、vaditvā、vivaditvā”等，则是以 tuṃ 等结尾的词形。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-844-2-6", "zh": "其中，**vāda**就是言论。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-844-7-13", "zh": "应当说的、该说的，称为 vajja。那是什么呢？", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-844-14-15", "zh": "就是言语。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-844-16-32", "zh": "在“凭这句真实语，愿我与夫君团聚”这句里，言语就称为 vajja。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-844-33-38", "zh": "人们用它来说话，所以叫 vadana，也就是嘴。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-844-39-43", "zh": "嘴的名称有以下这些：", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-845-2-9", "zh": "vadana、lapana、tuṇḍa，mukha 以及 ānana；", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-846-2-6", "zh": "应当知道，tuṇḍa 特指猪等动物的嘴。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-847-2-8", "zh": "其中，**vadati**的用例如“父亲对儿子说话”。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-847-9-18", "zh": "另外，**vadati**也用于“鼓响”，意思是发出声音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-847-19-24", "zh": "**vajjati**这里也是同样的道理。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-848-2-8", "zh": "这里的词形变化表如下：vadati、vadanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-848-9-12", "zh": "vadasi、vadatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-848-13-16", "zh": "vadāmi、vadāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-848-17-20", "zh": "vadate、vadante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-848-21-24", "zh": "vadase、vadavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-848-25-28", "zh": "vade、vadamhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-849-2-5", "zh": "vadatu、vadantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-849-6-11", "zh": "vadāhi、vada、vadatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-849-12-15", "zh": "vadāmi、vadāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-849-16-19", "zh": "vadataṃ、vadantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-849-20-23", "zh": "vadassu、vadavho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-849-24-27", "zh": "vade、vadāmase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-850-2-5", "zh": "vajjati、vajjanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-850-6-9", "zh": "vajjasi、vajjatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-850-10-13", "zh": "vajjāmi、vajjāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-850-14-17", "zh": "vajjate、vajjante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-850-18-21", "zh": "vajjase、vajjavhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-850-22-25", "zh": "vajje、vajjamhe。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-851-2-6", "zh": "vajjatu、vajjantu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-851-7-12", "zh": "vajjāhi、vajja、vajjatha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-851-13-16", "zh": "vajjāmi、vajjāma。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-851-17-20", "zh": "vajjataṃ、vajjantaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-851-21-24", "zh": "vajjassu、vajjavho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-851-25-28", "zh": "vajje、vajjāmhase。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "16-851-29-38", "zh": "应当知道，这两套词形变化表，是按 vada 根有 vajja 这一替换形而列出的。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-851-39-56", "zh": "这里有一个精细的义理辨析：圣典说“人间与天上的乐器，当下一齐奏响（vajjanti）”。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-851-57-63", "zh": "这里的**vajjanti**是单纯主动形式，因为它表示的就是乐器自己发声。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-851-64-66", "zh": "好比什么呢？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-852-2-9", "zh": "“让螺号与小鼓响起来，让单面鼓奏鸣；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-853-2-11", "zh": "让备好的大鼓轰鸣，让悦耳的天鼓鸣响”这样。", "confidence": 70}
